 75CU2cG were assumed either to be pure M1 or E2. The multipolarity of the      
 75CU3cG |g-ray transitions were estimated depending on whether the             
 75CU4cG multipolarity of 61.7|g was a pure M1 or a pure E2 and from the        
 75CU5cG I{-total}, the decay pattern, the possible configuration of the        
 75CU6cG states and the comparison with the measured T{-1/2} in 2016Pe14. The   
 75CU7cG compiler did not quote the possible multipolarity scenarios. Please    
 75CU8cG see Table 1 for the possible multipolarity scenarios for each |g-ray   
 75CU9cG transition.                                                            
